times; &amp;divide; &amp;ne; &amp;le; &amp;ge; &amp;infin; &amp;sum; &amp;int;</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="X5DmU" id="X5DmU"><span data-lake-id="ucac3d3f5" id="ucac3d3f5">脚注变体</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua8f8db41" id="ua8f8db41"><span data-lake-id="u82739f88" id="u82739f88">带标签的脚注</span><a href="这是第一个脚注。" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u1677fb28" id="u1677fb28"><span data-lake-id="u665306e5" id="u665306e5">^note1</span></a><span data-lake-id="u1cf7e90d" id="u1cf7e90d">和带文本的脚注</span><a href="这是第二个脚注，有多行内容。" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u15dd6ab6" id="u15dd6ab6"><span data-lake-id="udf73f25b" id="udf73f25b">^note2</span></a><span data-lake-id="uf765398a" id="uf765398a">。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="qUMfP" id="qUMfP"><span data-lake-id="u9eba01e9" id="u9eba01e9">缩写</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ufc4bb38d" id="ufc4bb38d"><span data-lake-id="u41109044" id="u41109044">HTML 是超文本标记语言。<br />*[HTML]: HyperText Markup Language</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="J29Do" id="J29Do"><span data-lake-id="ue68a1e6a" id="ue68a1e6a">评论/注释</span></h2><h2 data-lake-id="aT942" id="aT942"><span data-lake-id="ud1fb5084" id="ud1fb5084">行内 HTML</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u1de2074b" id="u1de2074b"><span data-lake-id="u40ce1bb0" id="u40ce1bb0">这是</span><sub><span data-lake-id="u08e0cc5d" id="u08e0cc5d">下标</span></sub><span data-lake-id="u29b6489b" id="u29b6489b">和</span><sup><span data-lake-id="u9d815994" id="u9d815994">上标</span></sup><span data-lake-id="uf2c8fbc4" id="uf2c8fbc4">的 HTML 写法。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u65a7c757" id="u65a7c757"><span data-lake-id="ueac76d7c" id="ueac76d7c">这是</span><span data-lake-id="u7c62c646" id="u7c62c646">高亮</span><span data-lake-id="u6e76f270" id="u6e76f270">的 HTML 写法。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uee59cabf" id="uee59cabf"><span data-lake-id="ubd50f90b" id="ubd50f90b">这是</span><span data-lake-id="u99ecb5f6" id="u99ecb5f6">小字</span><span data-lake-id="u449d90a8" id="u449d90a8">和</span><span data-lake-id="u7d3834ac" id="u7d3834ac">大字</span><span data-lake-id="u17f61090" id="u17f61090">。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="APICm" id="APICm"><span data-lake-id="u3e4dc2a5" id="u3e4dc2a5">引用中的代码</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id="u5797da04" id="u5797da04"><p data-lake-id="ub477d927" id="ub477d927"><span data-lake-id="ucf24a2ca" id="ucf24a2ca">引用中的行内代码：</span><code data-lake-id="u5101940c" id="u5101940c"><span data-lake-id="ub8ee0794" id="ub8ee0794">code</span></code></p><p data-lake-id="ucf3dbe20" id="ucf3dbe20"><span data-lake-id="u6d7020e3" id="u6d7020e3">引用中的代码块：</span></p></blockquote><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20foo()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20pass%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22kw3OD%22%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="mg088" id="mg088"><span data-lake-id="ue83ee020" id="ue83ee020">代码块中的特殊字符</span></h2><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%5Cns%20%3D%20%5C%22%3C%3E%26%5C%5C%5C%22'%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%22%5Cnd%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22key%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22value%5C%22%7D%5Cnprint(f%5C%22Hello%20%7Bs%7D%5C%22)%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ot612%22%7D"></card><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22special%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%3C%3E%26%5C%5C%5C%22'%5C%5C%5C%5C%2F%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ct%5C%5Cr%5C%22%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22id%22%3A%22uFsKw%22%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="HhT1p" id="HhT1p"><span data-lake-id="uf44dcd7e" id="uf44dcd7e">长 URL 测试</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4995b06a" id="u4995b06a"><a href="https://www.yuque.com/feng-oftto/gpqwqv/lake-format-full-test?tab=overview&amp;token=abc123&amp;signature=xyz456" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u64b7ff1c" id="u64b7ff1c"><span data-lake-id="u6be9a8c5" id="u6be9a8c5"